# Frontend UI

**All UI and design-system rules live in [frontend.mdc](./frontend.mdc).** Read that file before creating or styling components.

Quick reminders:

- Dark glass dashboard (`#0a0f1a`, `glass-panel`, teal/cyan accents, Framer Motion)
- shadcn/ui from `@/components/ui/*`
- Reuse `MeshBackground`, `StatCard`, `AnimatedNumber` under `components/dashboard/`
